    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1006">

                <pb facs="0772" n="696" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg696"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.48/3205</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Guyant to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Progreso</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-06-22">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 22, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Can get Porto Ricans out on freighter <hi rendition="#italic">New Orleans</hi>
                    seventeen dollars each, sailing probably Sunday. Wire authorization, if
                    approved, and make necessary arrangements, quarantine authorities establish
                    camp. Quickest action necessary.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Guyant</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
